OL,3,GNEWSAMayors fear tourism tax would put
OL,4,Avisitors off
OL,5,
OL,6,FElected mayors in East Yorkshire and
OL,7,FLincolnshire say they have no plans to
OL,8,Fintroduce a tourist tax.
OL,10,FUnder new government plans, regional
OL,11,Fmayors in England would have the power
OL,12,Fto introduce a charge on overnight
OL,13,Faccommodation stays.
OL,15,FIt would be an uncapped fee as a
OL,16,Fpercentage of the cost of hotels, bed
OL,17,Fand breakfasts and other types of
OL,18,Faccommodation, and the money could go
OL,19,Ftowards improving high streets and
OL,20,Flocal transport, the government said.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
