OL,3,GNEWSAMayors fear tourism tax would put
OL,4,Avisitors off
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Luke Campbell, mayor of Hull and
OL,7,FEast Yorkshire, said his "instinct" was
OL,8,Fnot to implement it, while Greater
OL,9,FLincolnshire's Dame Andrea Jenkyns said
OL,10,Fshe did not want to drive visitors
OL,11,Faway.
